{"v":2,"s":"m","w":5,"steps":[{"t":"read","h":"Rules for powers","b":"<p>aⁿ = a · a · … · a (n times). The rules:</p><div class=\"fx\">aᵐ · aⁿ = aᵐ⁺ⁿ   aᵐ : aⁿ = aᵐ⁻ⁿ   (aᵐ)ⁿ = aᵐⁿ</div><div class=\"fx\">(ab)ⁿ = aⁿbⁿ   a⁰ = 1 (a ≠ 0)   a⁻ⁿ = 1/aⁿ</div><div class=\"callout\">Fold a sheet of paper in half again and again: its thickness goes 2, 4, 8, 16… that’s 2ⁿ.</div><figure class=\"fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 128\" text-anchor=\"middle\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Each fold doubles the thickness: 1, 2, 4, 8, 16, 32 — powers of 2 grow fast.\"><defs><marker id=\"ah\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" class=\"ink\"/></marker><marker id=\"ahc\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" class=\"a\"/></marker></defs><rect x=\"40\" y=\"8\" width=\"7.5\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" class=\"a\"/><text x=\"32\" y=\"19\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\">2⁰</text><text x=\"53.5\" y=\"19\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"11\">1</text><rect x=\"40\" y=\"28\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" class=\"a\"/><text x=\"32\" y=\"39\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\">2¹</text><text x=\"61\" y=\"39\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"11\">2</text><rect x=\"40\" y=\"48\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" class=\"a\"/><text x=\"32\" y=\"59\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\">2²</text><text x=\"76\" y=\"59\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"11\">4</text><rect x=\"40\" y=\"68\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" class=\"a\"/><text x=\"32\" y=\"79\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\">2³</text><text x=\"106\" y=\"79\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"11\">8</text><rect x=\"40\" y=\"88\" width=\"120\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" class=\"a\"/><text x=\"32\" y=\"99\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\">2⁴</text><text x=\"166\" y=\"99\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"11\">16</text><rect x=\"40\" y=\"108\" width=\"240\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" class=\"a\"/><text x=\"32\" y=\"119\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\">2⁵</text><text x=\"286\" y=\"119\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"11\">32</text></svg><figcaption>Each fold doubles the thickness: 1, 2, 4, 8, 16, 32 — powers of 2 grow fast.</figcaption></figure>"},{"t":"read","h":"Square roots","b":"<p>√a is the non-negative number whose square is a: √49 = 7.</p><ul><li>√(ab) = √a · √b → simplify: √72 = √(36·2) = 6√2</li><li>Rationalize: 1/√2 = √2/2</li></ul>"},{"t":"read","h":"Scientific notation","b":"<p>Write very large or small numbers as <b>a · 10ⁿ</b> with 1 ≤ a < 10.</p><ul><li>602 200 000 000 000 000 000 000 = 6.022 · 10²³ (Avogadro’s number)</li><li>0.00045 = 4.5 · 10⁻⁴</li></ul><p>Multiplying: multiply the a’s, add the exponents. Dividing: divide the a’s, subtract the exponents.</p>"},{"t":"ex","q":"(3 · 10⁴) · (2 · 10⁻⁷)","s":["Multiply the numbers: 3 · 2 = 6.","Add the exponents: 4 + (−7) = −3."],"a":"6 · 10⁻³"},{"t":"num","q":"2³ · 2² = ?","a":32,"u":"","e":"2⁵ = 32."},{"t":"num","q":"5⁰ = ?","a":1,"u":"","e":"Any non-zero number to the power 0 is 1."},{"t":"mc","q":"10⁻² equals:","o":["−100","0.01","−0.01","0.1"],"a":1,"e":"1/10² = 1/100."},{"t":"mc","q":"√48 simplified:","o":["4√3","3√4","2√12","16√3"],"a":0,"e":"√(16·3) = 4√3."},{"t":"mc","q":"0.00056 in scientific notation:","o":["56 · 10⁻⁵","5.6 · 10⁻⁴","5.6 · 10⁻³","0.56 · 10⁻³"],"a":1,"e":"Move the decimal point 4 places right → 10⁻⁴."},{"t":"num","q":"(4 · 10⁵) : (2 · 10²) as an ordinary number?","a":2000,"u":"","e":"2 · 10³ = 2000."}]}